  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="text-align: center">Robert Lisicki</td><td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: center">9,361,117</td><td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: center">345,211</td><td style="text-align: center">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: center">2,141,280</td></tr>
  </table>




<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proposal 2</span>. <span style="text-decoration: underline">Ratification of the appointment
of WithumSmith+Brown, P.C. as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the year ending December 31, 2024</span>.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The stockholders ratified and approved the appointment of WithumSmith+Brown,
P.C. as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm for the year ending December 31, 2024 based on the votes listed
below:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center">Votes For</td><td style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center">Votes Against</td><td style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center">Abstentions</td><td style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center">Broker Non-Votes</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="width: 25%; text-align: center">11,656,697</td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: center">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 24%; text-align: center">36,059</td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: center">&#160;</td>
